            <ol class="step-list">
              <li>Disable Global Desktop Audio in OBS Settings > Audio.</li>
              <li>Add individual Application Audio Capture sources: <code>Audio_Game</code>, <code>Audio_Discord</code>, and <code>Audio_Music</code>.</li>
              <li>In OBS Settings > Output > Recording (Advanced mode), check <strong>Audio Tracks 1, 2, 3, and 4</strong>.</li>
